pace keeps going with a huge rec room, third bedroom, den, 3-piece bath and plenty of storage. Updates over the years include vinyl flooring, furnace with UV filter, hot water tank, sump pump, countertops, appliances, plumbing fixtures and low-flow toilets. Walk to Giroux Crossing and Sturgeon Community Hospital. Rarely available, well located and a lot of bungalow for the money. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$400,000"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,238 sq ft"],["Year built","1992"],["Storeys","1"],["Condo fee","$382 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Deer Ridge"],["Town","St. Albert"],["Postal code","T8N6E1"],["MLS® number","E4512260"],["Listed","October 8, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Central Vacuum, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.08 m × 4.17 m (13'5\" × 13'8\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.03 m × 3.04 m (13'3\" × 10'0\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.36 m × 5.46 m (7'9\" × 17'11\")"],["Family room","Basement","5.87 m × 10.12 m (19'3\" × 33'2\")"],["Den","Basement","2.51 m × 2.97 m (8'3\" × 9'9\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.92 m × 5.13 m (12'10\" × 16'10\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.09 m × 3.92 m (10'2\" × 12'10\")"],["Bedroom 3","Basement","4.12 m × 2.98 m (13'6\" × 9'9\")"]],"courtesy":"Jason Kamal, Exp Realty and Matthew Barry, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"st-albert","hood_slug":"deer-ridge","area":""}